.TH CP2077-MOD-TUI 1 "July 2026" "cp2077-mod-tui 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
cp2077-mod-tui \- isolated Cyberpunk 2077 mod manager and launcher
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cp2077-mod-tui
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manages immutable mod releases and isolated loadout profiles without changing
the Steam Cyberpunk 2077 game tree, Steam launch options, or Steam Proton prefix.
With no command, opens the terminal user interface.
.PP
The TUI Add mode Inbox pane scans ./mods relative to the current working
directory. It can also accept an arbitrary directory or archive path
interactively. Navigation uses a left HUD rail and three modes: Loadout,
Add, and Runtime. h/l switch inner panes. Press t to cycle theme presets,
d to delete a library release, and ? for the key overlay.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor [--json]
Inspect Steam discovery, runtime dependencies, REDmod, and the vanilla tree.
.TP
.B import PATH [--name NAME] [--version VERSION] [--profile PROFILE]
Safely import a local archive or directory.
.TP
.B profile list|create|show
Manage isolated profiles.
.TP
.B mod list|enable|disable|disable-all|priority
Inspect, toggle, and order installed mods.
.TP
.B framework list|fetch
Inspect or download curated frameworks from official upstream releases.
.TP
.B conflicts PROFILE
List exact path collisions in the effective loadout.
.TP
.B prepare PROFILE
Create the dedicated UMU prefix and install Windows prerequisites.
.TP
.B launch PROFILE [--dry-run] [--force]
Materialize and launch an isolated profile. Force acknowledges a changed Steam
build ID; it does not bypass broken dependencies.
.TP
.B backup|restore
Manage isolated saves and runtime-state backups.
.TP
.B theme list|set
Manage four-color TUI theme presets.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cp2077-mod-tui/config.toml
Theme configuration.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/cp2077-mod-tui
SQLite database, archives, releases, profiles, prefixes, and backups.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/cp2077-mod-tui
Transient FUSE mountpoints and runtime state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR steam (6),
.BR umu (1),
.BR fuse-overlayfs (1),
.BR winetricks (1)
